00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Close your eyes. This is lightning, heard from space.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Earth Jukebox turns NASA Earth visualizations into live music — played from their pixels.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Each map's own colour bar turns colours back into data: warmer water, higher notes.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Blind and low-vision users can explore any map by touch or keyboard.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Seven NASA datasets. One planet. Listen.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Earth Jukebox — data: NASA Scientific Visualization Studio.
